# Wire forms

A record marked `#Codable(published)` keeps its shape; `#Codable(.Skip)` and `#Codable(.Flatten)`
shape one field, and `#Codable(unknown: .Deny)` refuses a stray key.

```jet
#[Codable(only: .Encode), Rename(.Camel)]
Reply: struct { ok: Bool }
```

C# code and a `#Encoded` word stay as written.
